<title>ISRAEL: Clal Trading Q1 loss 16.2 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Clal Trading Q1 loss 16.2 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Clal Trading Ltd, a subsidiary of Clal Israel.</p>
<p>		 (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>				    Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue			 268,977    316,534</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit (loss)     (11,654)    22,836</p>
<p>Net profit (loss)	   (16,159)     8,716</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share   (0.45)	0.24</p>
<p>A Clal spokesman said he could not immediately comment on the results.</p>
<p>- Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-537-0502</p>
<p>($1=3.40 shekels)</p>
